          <rules>
            <rule name="Iron Will" id="4ca8-0f9e-a374-90ea" hidden="false">
              <description>An Inquisitor Lord can choose whether to pass or fail any Morale or Pinning test he is called upton to make. Even if failure is normally automatic, the Lord may still choose whether to pass or fail the test.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="The Voice" id="f765-2842-b9c9-e41a" hidden="false">
              <description>Use this Psyker phase in the shooting phase by targeting an enemy unit within 24&quot;. If the psychic test is passed, roll D6 for both Eisenhorn and the target unit, adding the Leadership of both units. If Eisenhorn&apos;s total exceeds the target unit, all shooting attacks at that unit are at +1 to hit for the whole of the Shooting Phase.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
