                <rule name="Pathfinder" id="8cc5-592c-5c73-cab5" hidden="false">
                  <description>An Inquisitor and their retinue roll an additional dice when determining how far they can move through difficult terrain.


If accompanied by two or more Pathfinders the Inquisitor may make a Scout move at the start of the game. After both sides have deployed, but before determining the player who takes first turn, the Inquisitor and their retinue may make a free move using the normal movement rules.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
